msgid "Difficulty and ball speed has six levels: Easy, Normal, Hard, Insane, Impossible and Nightmare. Higher settings start with a faster ball. Against a bot, they also change reaction time, movement, aim and the chance of an error. The bot tracks the visible ball with limited precision and does not track an invisible ball. It may still return an invisible ball if its paddle happens to be in the right place."
msgstr ""

msgid "Difficulty and ball speed offers Easy, Normal and Hard; Normal is the default. The first flight takes 1.5 seconds on Easy, 1.2 seconds on Normal and 0.9 seconds on Hard. Each later shot in the rally increases speed by 10 percent on Easy and Normal, or 8 percent on Hard. A new point returns to the initial speed."
msgstr ""

