#: games/generated/rulebooks/spades.rb:16
msgid "The highest spade wins. If nobody played a spade, the highest card of the led suit wins. A high card in another suit does not win merely because it is high. For example, an ace of hearts cannot beat a low club in a club-led trick unless hearts were the led suit instead."
msgstr ""

#: games/generated/rulebooks/duck_racing.rb:64
msgid "The highest total no greater than 21 wins. Each loser pays the difference between their total and the winner's, even after going over. Exceeding 21 also costs one additional feather for each point over, paid to the game. With totals of 20 and 24, the loser gives the winner four feathers and loses three more. If everyone goes over, only these additional penalties are paid."
msgstr ""

#: games/generated/rulebooks/duck_racing.rb:57
