msgid "Your current mileage contributes to your score. Normally, distance cards add miles; under counterflow, they subtract miles without going below zero. Each safety scores 100 points; a dirty trick adds 300. Reaching exactly 1000 miles earns a 300-point victory bonus. Reaching the finish with an empty draw pile adds another 300 points."
